					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-11752337#post-4248058</guid>
				<title>The Ursus Maritimus Incident: The origin of WWS (Now with a new ending!)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-11752337/critter-profile:the-polar-bear#post-4248058</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 14 May 2019 00:42:14 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>DrAnnoyingDog</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2425082</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>So I had wrote a big important author post for this when it was up the first time, but I forgot what I wrote, so you get this instead.</p> <p>This is a part of trilogy along with <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/on-the-radar">On The Radar</a> and <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/uiu-file-2008-21">UIU File: 008-21</a> that tells the origins of Wilson's Wildlife Solutions as we know it today. This is the Ursus Maritimus behind the &quot;Ursus Maritimus Incident&quot;.</p> <p>Special thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/darkstuff" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1581620&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1557795294" alt="DarkStuff" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1581620)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/darkstuff" >DarkStuff</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3487700&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1557795294" alt="Uncle Nicolini" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3487700)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" >Uncle Nicolini</a></span>,and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormbreath" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3075960&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1557795294" alt="stormbreath" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3075960)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormbreath" >stormbreath</a></span> for critiquing this!</p> <p>I hope you enjoy! :&gt;</p> <p>ATTRIBUTIONS<br /> <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:PolarBear3_CincinnatiZoo.jpg">https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:PolarBear3_CincinnatiZoo.jpg</a><br /> <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tickle_Creek,_Boring,_Oregon.png">https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tickle_Creek,_Boring,_Oregon.png</a></p> 
